======================================================================
 Dario Store: "check your spam" notes + team email alerts (admins and staff)
 Date:     2026-09-26 19:19:54 CET
 Branch:   main @ 0845ac6 (changes not committed yet)
======================================================================

SUMMARY
  1. Every screen that says "we sent you an email / a code" now adds "Can't find it? Check your
     spam or junk folder." (English + French).
  2. Staff accounts now receive every team email, like admins.
  3. New: the team is emailed when a customer writes in an order chat.
  Tests: 254 passed in 22 files (12 new). Typecheck, lint, build pass. Checked in a browser.
  No database change.

======================================================================
1. SPAM NOTES (texts in src/i18n/messages/en.ts + fr.ts)
======================================================================
  order.thanksText      order page after checkout (the order confirmation email)
  auth.sentCode         sign-up / log-in / forgot-password code step
  auth.notVerified      log-in with an unverified email (a code is sent)
  auth.sentNewCode      "Resend code"
  chatSystem.deliveredEmail   already said "Check your inbox (and your spam folder)"
  The "payment confirmed" email is announced in the chat, not as "we emailed you", so no note.
  Guard: src/i18n/email-notes.test.ts fails if one of these texts loses its spam note.

======================================================================
2 + 3. TEAM EMAILS (src/services/order-notifications.ts)
======================================================================
  Recipients (teamAddresses): the admins (ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL if set, otherwise every ADMIN
  account) + every STAFF account, each address once (case-insensitive). ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL is
  not set in .env today, so: every admin and staff account.

  Email                      When
  New order                  every order (unchanged, now also to staff)
  Payment sent               customer taps "Payment sent" (now also to staff)
  Problem reported           customer uses "Report a problem" (now also to staff)
  New message (NEW)          customer writes in an order chat, only when it is the one message
                             the team hasn't read yet: a burst of messages = one email, and the
                             next email comes after the team has opened the chat. Says whether a
                             photo came with it. Never contains the message text (chat stays
                             encrypted). Team messages never trigger it. "Payment sent" and
                             "Report a problem" keep their own emails.
  In the app: the unread badges on the orders list work as before (admins and staff).
  All emails still go out only once SMTP_HOST + MAIL_FROM are set (lib/email.ts).

Files: src/services/order-notifications.ts, src/services/messages.ts, src/prisma/users.ts
(findStaff, read-only), src/i18n/messages/en.ts + fr.ts, README.md, CLAUDE.md.

